    "title": "OneNexus Central Auth Service — Customer API",
    "description": "Customer-facing JSON RPC operations under `/api/*`. OAuth 2.1 / OIDC protocol endpoints under `/connect/*` are documented separately by their respective specs and the OIDC discovery document at `/connect/.well-known/openid-configuration`.",
